import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/editorial.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="Services" description="Hyphos Inc. connects business systems, builds custom software and apps, and puts practical AI to work. Start with the work that's getting stuck.">
<section class="product-editorial-hero page-shell"><p class="section-label">Consulting &amp; Software</p><h1>Build Around<br />The Way You Work</h1><p>Start with a real constraint. Connect what's useful. Build what's missing. Make the result something your team can run.</p><a href="/contact" class="button button--gold">Talk Through A Problem <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
<section class="pilot-steps page-shell">
  <article id="connect"><span class="section-label">01 / Connect Existing Systems</span><div><h2>Close The Gaps People<br />Are Bridging By Hand</h2><p>Accounting, customer information, scheduling, websites and documents. When the systems share information, your team spends less time retyping, checking and chasing.</p><p>We map the workflow, find the handoffs that create the most friction, and build the connections around them.</p><a href="/work/cornerstone" class="text-link">See The Connected Software <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article>
  <article id="custom"><span class="section-label">02 / Custom Software &amp; Apps</span><div><h2>When The Tool Doesn't Fit,<br />Change The Tool</h2><p>Internal applications, customer portals, mobile apps and business platforms. Software shaped around your terminology, your processes and the exceptions that matter.</p><p>We show working increments early, so the people who know the work can shape the result.</p><a href="/work#wander" class="text-link">See How We Built Wander <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article>
  <article id="ai"><span class="section-label">03 / Practical AI &amp; Automation</span><div><h2>Put The Right Information<br />Within Reach</h2><p>Useful AI starts with the business context behind the question. We look at the information, the sources and the decisions a workflow depends on, then automate the parts that can be checked.</p><p>The same thinking is behind Hyphos, our knowledge and work platform.</p><a href="/field-notes/ten-ways-small-businesses-use-ai/" class="text-link">Read: 10 Ways Small Businesses Are Using AI <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article>
</section>
<section class="product-editorial-closing page-shell"><span class="section-label">The First Conversation</span><h2>Bring One Thing<br />That Takes Too Much Effort</h2><p>Tell us what happens today, which systems are involved and who has to hold it together. We'll start from there.</p><a href="/contact" class="button button--gold">Talk With Us <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
</BaseLayout>
